# Cursor Rules — Universal AI Engineering Standards
# Referenced from scripted_AI/ framework

# 0. Project Context & Living Memory
- Before modifying code, read files in scripted_AI/project_context/ (overview, business rules, handover notes, gotchas).
- Check "Do Not Touch Zones" and credentials before proposing architectural changes.

# 1. Behavior & Tone
- Be concise, direct, and pragmatic.
- Prioritize root-cause diagnosis followed by exact, minimal diffs.
- Always provide clickable markdown links for all modified files and symbols.

# 2. Safety & Verification
- ALWAYS inspect existing code before generating suggestions. Do not hallucinate imports.
- Never execute destructive shell commands (rm -rf, git reset --hard, DROP TABLE).
- Always verify changes via local build/test commands before declaring completion.
- Clarification Gate: Ask 2-3 edge-case questions for complex features before generating code. Small tasks execute directly.
- Lesson Extraction: When prompted to save lessons, format as Root Cause -> Anti-Pattern -> Defensive Pattern into gotchas or domain standards.
- ONLY commit or update work logs when explicitly instructed by the user.

# 3. Domain-Specific Guidelines
# Game Development:
- Unity: 100% English only (Code, UI, Comments, Logs). Zero GC allocations in Update/FixedUpdate.
- Cache all references in Awake/Start. Use Object Pooling for recurring entities.

# Web Development:
- React/Next.js: Keep Server Components by default. Use TanStack Query/Zustand. Validate with Zod.
- Backend: RESTful standard status codes, Clean Architecture separation, Parameterized SQL queries.

# Desktop App:
- Never block the UI thread. Use async/await for all IO. Handle single-instance and tray properly.

# Mobile Development:
- Flutter: Sound null safety, const constructors, feature-first structure.
- React Native: Reanimated 3 for 60fps gestures, FlashList for long virtualized lists.

# UI/UX Design Intelligence:
- For new UI pages, dashboards, color palettes, or typography, use scripted_AI/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/scripts/search.py --design-system (offline BM25 search, 0 token).
